        <mxCell id="steps" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Architecture Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Event producer publishes events&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;② EventBridge routes to SQS queue&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;③ EventBridge routes to Step Functions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;④ EventBridge fans out to SNS topic&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑤ SQS triggers Lambda for processing&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑥ SNS triggers Lambda for notifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑦ Lambda persists results to DynamoDB" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#E0E0E0;fontSize=12;spacing=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
